T OPENDOC Report.txt
T OPEN Reader 1
T FRONT Reader 1
T SET Reader.Path.text Report.txt
T OPENDOC My Notes.txt
T OPEN Reader 2
T FRONT Reader 2
T SET Reader.Path.text My Notes.txt
T FIRE Reader.closeRequest
T CLOSE Reader 2
T FRONT Reader 1
T FIRE Reader.closed
T FIRE Reader.closeRequest
T CLOSE Reader 1
T FIRE Reader.closed
